43:45.499 --> 43:48.755
trying to get you to tell them. Is, uh, we're gonna go from 10 lanes

43:48.851 --> 43:51.933
to 1 each direction, 2 total.

43:52.013 --> 43:55.961
So that's, uh, that's gonna be a huge problem in 2029, and I

43:56.411 --> 43:58.706
wanna make sure that we have a focus on that. Yeah, that's great.

43:59.540 --> 44:02.879
Um, my— when they passed that last year, my suspicion was

44:02.975 --> 44:06.153
that they were gonna go to the next phase, but we wanna make sure.

44:06.827 --> 44:10.149
Yep. Um, were there any other specific bills or anything that we

44:10.649 --> 44:13.905
need? I'll just, I'll just put out some long-range planning kind of some feelers that

44:14.405 --> 44:17.550
