44:51.254 --> 44:54.029
Tooele. I think that is a natural kind of flow,

44:54.190 --> 44:57.722
right? I just think that, I think long-term we

44:58.222 --> 45:01.367
have to be looking at those things and preserving corridor and starting to figure out

45:01.415 --> 45:05.108
what does it look like 20, 30 years down the road, long after none

45:05.608 --> 45:09.646
of us are here to benefit from it. 'Cause we're gonna have sons

45:10.146 --> 45:13.176
and grandsons and granddaughters and anyway,

45:13.563 --> 45:17.369
that are gonna need to be serviced by those things. Well, and I'll say

45:17.418 --> 45:21.979
something that's unique about your valley is it's developable,

45:22.720 --> 45:26.221
but it's also proximate to the other major urban

45:26.721 --> 45:30.222
