46:21.675 --> 46:25.104
that would be awesome. Yeah, yeah. The— and

46:25.604 --> 46:28.677
the— and you mentioned SB 231 sandal, right? Uh,

46:29.831 --> 46:33.132
and I'm halfway joking, but if they want us to share, they should share with

