47:14.189 --> 47:18.025
and he knows this. He and I talked about this, but the effort,

47:18.506 --> 47:21.827
The idea and the effort, his— A for effort. Yeah, yeah,

47:22.116 --> 47:25.180
A for effort on his part. Dan, we appreciate you being here.

