54:31.479 --> 54:34.762
at least 51% LMI. Okay. Or in the case of the ADA ramps, it serves

54:34.875 --> 54:38.386
disabled people, which is that bottom line, presumed eligible groups.

54:38.434 --> 54:41.929
We don't have to track income. So always easier to do a project

54:42.512 --> 54:44.483
that is for a presumed eligible group.

54:49.786 --> 54:53.209
Okay. And so our ideal submission deadline date

54:53.709 --> 54:57.456
