01:52:42.310 --> 01:52:45.503
Thank you, Mayor. Um, it's awesome to have so many of our first

01:52:46.003 --> 01:52:49.850
responders here. My dad was a firefighter when I was a little girl, so I

01:52:50.316 --> 01:52:53.043
have a special place in my heart for all of you guys. Thank you for

01:52:53.543 --> 01:52:55.626
all that you do, and thank you to your families because I know it's a

01:52:56.126 --> 01:53:00.054
huge sacrifice as well. Um, and I'm grateful to have so many residents here

01:53:00.599 --> 01:53:03.166
to just kind of share their thoughts about things that are going on in the

01:53:03.666 --> 01:53:06.479
city, and we're grateful when you bring things to our attention.

01:53:09.093 --> 01:53:12.837
We as a city are growing and

01:53:12.934 --> 01:53:15.665
changing, and there's lots of things that we have on our agenda.

