03:12:06.654 --> 03:12:08.978
able to install some of those trails at a low cost.

03:12:10.773 --> 03:12:12.556
Um, but I do know putting in landscaping,

03:12:14.494 --> 03:12:17.808
um, it comes— irrigation systems come with a significant cost,

03:12:18.357 --> 03:12:22.351
uh, watering turf comes with a cost, and all those things. And just with

03:12:22.415 --> 03:12:25.232
the climate of everything, we just got to be wise in the decisions that we

03:12:25.248 --> 03:12:28.637
make. Thank you. So just as a council,

03:12:28.653 --> 03:12:32.356
maybe, and mayor, just— we'll just keep track as we're residents reach out

03:12:32.485 --> 03:12:36.194
to those various projects and add them into this next budget year.

03:12:36.419 --> 03:12:39.726
I think what I heard is he said you're the only squeaky wheel. That's,

03:12:40.096 --> 03:12:43.500
I think, what I just heard. That's kind of

03:12:44.000 --> 03:12:47.337
what I took. But he responded. He got it done. It's awesome.

03:12:47.417 --> 03:12:50.195
Yeah, we'll keep track of those.

03:12:51.496 --> 03:12:55.092
Obviously, there's a lot of trails here that I think we could connect and probably

03:12:55.125 --> 03:12:58.062
pretty inexpensive. That's one that we could definitely Put on.

03:12:58.672 --> 03:13:02.024
Sorry, one other thing that I think is really important. When the

