03:13:09.628 --> 03:13:13.109
the RAP tax board and the grants for that.

03:13:13.189 --> 03:13:16.734
So one thing that I'm really excited about is now we're going to have this

03:13:16.926 --> 03:13:20.616
very specific pot of money that can be used for projects

03:13:21.116 --> 03:13:24.450
