03:13:28.252 --> 03:13:31.199
a need, and then this body of people are gonna be able to just help

03:13:31.279 --> 03:13:34.870
us decide as a council what we spend that money on.

03:13:34.966 --> 03:13:38.445
So like, there's a bright future ahead is what I'm trying to say.

03:13:38.990 --> 03:13:42.965
And I'll just say this on that point. I know I've had some conversations

03:13:42.981 --> 03:13:46.829
