03:13:47.329 --> 03:13:50.131
money's not— it's depreciating in value.

03:13:50.532 --> 03:13:54.734
To be quite frank, but at the same token, are there other

03:13:54.766 --> 03:13:58.069
needs that we could better use it for? Because this

03:13:58.150 --> 03:14:01.646
