03:20:54.932 --> 03:20:58.159
Thank you. So ultimately, this is a project

03:20:58.659 --> 03:21:02.077
that is much needed within our community to meet

03:21:02.577 --> 03:21:06.557
contractual obligations for the continued growth in our community and

03:21:06.669 --> 03:21:10.284
the entitlements that many of our, our developers have with within

03:21:10.319 --> 03:21:14.312
our community. This is

