03:21:30.484 --> 03:21:33.910
the city would consider. But this is the first step. The bond super

03:21:34.410 --> 03:21:38.936
parameter resolution is actually what it's It's called. And it's the first step that basically

03:21:38.968 --> 03:21:42.932
outlines the City Council's intent to move forward with projects

03:21:43.579 --> 03:21:46.806
both in our water and our sewer fund and outlines the,

03:21:46.984 --> 03:21:50.738
like I said, those guardrails around those projects. So the 3 projects that this

03:21:51.238 --> 03:21:54.702
project really, this potential bonding would cover,

03:21:55.250 --> 03:21:58.717
