03:27:48.561 --> 03:27:52.298
So the tip— great question. The typical— most,

03:27:52.812 --> 03:27:56.534
you know, when you go with a smaller issuance, when you go typically

03:27:57.034 --> 03:28:01.057
to a private institution or a single lender, there's a little bit more flexibility

03:28:01.314 --> 03:28:05.164
in those call provisions. For a potentially larger

03:28:05.664 --> 03:28:08.747
