03:31:33.260 --> 03:31:36.710
without paying higher interest costs.

03:31:37.513 --> 03:31:40.210
We are always able to get a 10-year par call,

03:31:40.869 --> 03:31:44.096
and sometimes I'm going to say, you know,

03:31:44.257 --> 03:31:47.709
