04:30:26.873 --> 04:30:29.228
meeting and it does have to do with finance, I was gonna do both.

04:30:29.340 --> 04:30:32.630
And I thought we talked about that. So if we do March 5th, 'cause if

04:30:33.130 --> 04:30:37.123
we come in anyway, the public hearing should be pretty light. That's a Thursday?

04:30:37.347 --> 04:30:40.573
Yeah, it's a Thursday. Yeah, but that's— So we're gonna—

04:30:40.637 --> 04:30:44.232
That public hearing is the $230 million thing.

04:30:44.569 --> 04:30:47.859
