04:31:48.001 --> 04:31:50.797
5 o'clock. 5:30, you're right, 5:30.

04:31:51.856 --> 04:31:55.450
Then we'll come, the second Tuesday of

04:31:55.706 --> 04:31:59.413
April would be the next meeting and then it's May. So those are

04:31:59.913 --> 04:32:02.702
the 2 meetings that we're looking for right now. Is that agreeable?

04:32:03.584 --> 04:32:07.515
And it'll be 3 to 5 on the second Tuesday of April. Is that gonna

04:32:08.015 --> 04:32:11.060
