04:32:49.907 --> 04:32:52.596
we can release you in May and you don't have to see us in May

04:32:53.096 --> 04:32:56.858
and June, rather than feel like, oh my gosh, we're having to adopt this

04:32:57.358 --> 04:32:59.999
