04:33:11.311 --> 04:33:15.403
it early and let's terminate it early if we can. So the 28th of April

04:33:15.903 --> 04:33:19.754
would be the 2nd Tuesday, or sorry, the 4th Tuesday, the 2nd meeting.

04:33:20.589 --> 04:33:23.447
That's my birthday. No, I've been here on my birthday a lot.

04:33:23.961 --> 04:33:27.317
We'll bring you a cake. So if you want,

04:33:27.365 --> 04:33:30.416
we can pencil it in if we need it, if that's— I am available.

04:33:31.359 --> 04:33:34.593
