04:33:34.641 --> 04:33:37.535
So the 28th of April, if you want to pencil it in, would that be—

04:33:38.035 --> 04:33:38.861
that would be a 3 to 5 as well.

04:33:41.169 --> 04:33:44.631
And then— Can we get calendar invites from this? Like from— Yeah.

04:33:45.452 --> 04:33:49.436
Terrence has got us. He'll take care of us. Okay. The 14th,

04:33:49.468 --> 04:33:52.892
the 28th. And then let's see how many we need. So the 5th,

04:33:52.989 --> 04:33:56.300
the 14th, and the 28th are our 3 budget meetings prior to the

04:33:56.380 --> 04:33:59.398
tentative budget and the public hearings, which will happen in June.

04:34:00.169 --> 04:34:03.525
Correct, and then in May, we can continue to have more meetings.

04:34:03.733 --> 04:34:07.009
So again, that's when we'll have the draft

04:34:07.509 --> 04:34:10.606
