04:34:49.412 --> 04:34:53.007
Okay, those are on the calendar. And then for today's

04:34:53.507 --> 04:34:56.939
discussion, it was, uh, it's not personnel. Yep, so that's all we're going

04:34:57.439 --> 04:35:01.641
to cover tonight because it is, uh, 10 o'clock and,

04:35:02.138 --> 04:35:05.749
um, you've covered enough. It's about— yep, it's covered enough. We'll make sure that

04:35:06.249 --> 04:35:09.600
we, um— so what the change is, because you're going to give us some dedicated

04:35:10.100 --> 04:35:14.238
